title: Swap sides in the layout menu puts the files and their bar of icons on the right, the other bar on the left, and back
folders: rust-small
forbid-log: WARN.*script
expect-file: ..\data\prefs.json :: "dock_right": false

wait 3000
ui click 1545 20
wait 700
mark a-menu
wait 400
ui click 1500 256
wait 900
mark b-on-the-right
wait 400
left changes
wait 800
mark c-source-control-on-the-right
wait 400
ui click 1500 256
wait 900
mark d-back-on-the-left
wait 400
quit
